---
---
<section id="about" class="about section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-label">
      <span class="label-num">01</span>
      <span class="label-text">About</span>
    </div>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-text">
        <h2 class="section-title">The person behind<br /><em>the stack.</em></h2>
        <p>
          I'm a system administrator and DevOps engineer from Moundsville, WV with over 15 years
          of hands-on experience in network buildout, server configuration, and cybersecurity.
          I believe in infrastructure that just <em>works</em> — secure, observable, and maintainable.
        </p>
        <p>
          Beyond the terminal, I'm a music lover, craft beer &amp; cider aficionado, and someone
          who's somehow managed to visit all 50 states. I also volunteer as Webmaster for the
          Virginia LGBTQ+ Network — because community matters.
        </p>
        <div class="about-contact-info">
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Location</span>
            <span class="info-value">Moundsville, WV</span>
          </div>
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Email</span>
            <a href="mailto:me@srlamartina.com" class="info-value">me@srlamartina.com</a>
          </div>
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Phone</span>
            <a href="tel:+19706660655" class="info-value">+1 (970) 666-0655</a>
          </div>
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Freelance</span>
            <span class="info-value available">Available ✓</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="services-grid">
        <h3 class="services-heading">What I Do</h3>
        <div class="services">
          <div class="service-card">
            <div class="service-icon">⚙️</div>
            <h4>Server Configuration</h4>
            <p>Setup, installation, and connection of servers and network devices with the OSes you need.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-card">
            <div class="service-icon">📡</div>
            <h4>Monitoring</h4>
            <p>Visibility and activity tracking on your servers — performance metrics and uptime reporting.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-card">
            <div class="service-icon">🔐</div>
            <h4>Cyber Security</h4>
            <p>Protecting your company from unauthorized or criminal use of electronic systems and data.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-card">
            <div class="service-icon">👥</div>
            <h4>User Management</h4>
            <p>Efficient management of users, accounts, and their access to various IT resources.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section {
    padding: 7rem 0;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }

  .section-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .label-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .label-text {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .section-label::after {
    content: '';
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--border);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .section-title em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .about-text p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-size: 0.97rem;
  }

  .about-contact-info {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .info-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .info-label {
    width: 80px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .info-value {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .info-value.available {
    color: var(--accent-2);
  }

  /* Services */
  .services-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .services {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--border);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .service-card {
    background: var(--bg);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }

  .service-card:hover {
    background: var(--bg-2);
  }

  .service-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .service-card h4 {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .service-card p {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 500px) {
    .services {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
